"description":"Create professional videos in seconds and join a global community of millions of creators using AI Video to produce viral content every day. As a fast-growing AI video generator and video maker, AI Video helps you turn text and photos into high-quality animated videos with just a few taps.\n\nUpload a photo, write a script, or choose a style — then generate scroll-stopping videos instantly. From text to video to photo to video, everything happens smoothly inside one intuitive app.\n\nTrusted by creators worldwide and built with privacy-first principles including data minimization and secure infrastructure, AI Video gives you a safe and powerful space to create, edit, and share videos across TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. \n\nWith AI video generator, you can:\n▶ Generate videos using an advanced AI text to video generator\n▶ Transform images into dynamic videos with AI photo to video and AI image to video tools\n▶ Create engaging short-form videos with an AI reel maker and AI short creator\n▶ Produce cinematic videos using AI movie maker and AI film generator features\n▶ Animate characters inside your videos with expressive facial emotions\n▶ Add voiceovers and automatic lip-sync to enhance your videos\n▶ Customize video transitions, timing, animation flow, and scene structure\n▶ Access a rich media library to upgrade every video you create\n\nEnhance your videos with creative video styles and effects including polaroid video filters, cinematic video looks, identity transforms, nano action video scenes, viral video effects, ASMR immersive video edits, and more.\nExport HD videos optimized for TikTok videos, Instagram Reel videos, YouTube Shorts videos, and other major video platforms.\n\n【 Simple. Fast. No Editing Skills Required.】\nYou don’t need professional video editing experience to create stunning videos.\nCreate videos in three easy steps:\n1. Write a script, choose a style, or upload a photo\n2. Tap generate with the AI video generator\n3. Edit and export your video instantly\n\nOne-tap video creation. Guided video flow. Instant video previews.\nNo complicated video timelines. No steep learning curve. Just intuitive video tools built for every creator who wants to make professional videos quickly.\n\nFrom idea → to animated video → to share-ready videos in minutes.\n\n【 Built with Privacy & Transparency at the Core 】\n\nYour videos and content belong to you. AI video generator follows privacy-first principles including data minimization and secure video processing infrastructure. Uploaded photos used for video generation are processed in real time and are not permanently stored after video creation is complete.\nWe do not sell user data. We use encrypted systems and controlled internal access for all video processing activities.\nWe follow GDPR and CCPA-aligned privacy practices.\nPrivacy Policy: https://aivideoart.co/privacy\nTerms of Use: https://aivideoart.co/terms\n\nRegular updates ensure improved video performance, enhanced AI video generator quality, and stronger security standards.\nHave questions, or need support? Reach out to us anytime at info@aivideoart.co\n\n【  Works Seamlessly with Your Favorite Platforms 】\nAI video maker fits naturally into your video content workflow.\nExport videos optimized for TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\nHD MP4 videos compatible across all major platforms.\n\nBuilt specifically for mobile video creators and content creators.\nWhether you're creating viral videos, marketing videos, storytelling videos, educational videos, cinematic videos, or branded social media videos. AI Video adapts to every creator and every video style.\n\n【 Start Creating Viral Videos Today 】\nDownload AI Video Generator and start creating high-quality videos instantly.\nCreate smarter videos. Create faster videos. Create with the power of an advanced AI video generator. \n\nThird-party model names are used solely for reference purposes to identify available AI models and do not imply any affiliation, endorsement or sponsorship.", "trackCensoredName":"AI Video - AI Video Generator", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/ai-video-ai-video-generator/id6478868302?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"17+", "averageUserRating":4.4900900000000003586819730116985738277435302734375, "bundleId":"ai.video.generator", "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "userRatingCount":27083}, 
